\"Service\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Professional Editing & Proofreading\"\r\n            }\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n            \"itemOffered\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Custom Book Cover Design\"\r\n            }\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n            \"itemOffered\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Ghostwriting\"\r\n            }\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n            \"itemOffered\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Book Marketing\"\r\n            }\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n            \"itemOffered\": {\r\n              \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n              \"name\": \"Global Book Distribution\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}",
                "{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Professional Book Publishers In Melbourne Australia\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Transform your manuscript into a professionally published e-book with our expert self-publishing services. Since 2005, we've helped authors publish their books online with secure, streamlined processes. Our experienced publishing team follows industry-leading standards to deliver high-quality e-books that meet professional formatting, design, and distribution requirements. From manuscript to market, we handle the complete publishing journey.\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/publishing/\",\r\n  \"inLanguage\": \"en-AU\",\r\n  \"isPartOf\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Melbourne Print & Publish\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"about\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/#localbusiness\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"primaryImageOfPage\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/assets/images/ProfessionalBook.webp\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"breadcrumb\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\r\n    \"itemListElement\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n        \"position\": 1,\r\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\r\n        \"item\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n        \"position\": 2,\r\n        \"name\": \"Publishing\",\r\n        \"item\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/publishing/\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}",
                "{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n  \"mainEntity\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Where can I submit a manuscript to Melbourne book publishers?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"You can submit your manuscript directly through our online portal at Ireland Publishing House. Unlike traditional Melbourne publishers who often require literary agents or lengthy submission windows, we accept manuscripts year-round across all genres. Simply upload your completed manuscript (Word or PDF format), and our team will review it within 2-3 business days. We provide a free consultation to discuss your publishing goals, recommended services, and transparent pricing. There's no need for query letters or formal book proposals—just your finished manuscript and a brief description of your project.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which Melbourne publishers accept unsolicited manuscripts?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"We welcome unsolicited manuscripts from authors across Australia and internationally. Many traditional Melbourne publishers only accept agented submissions or during specific reading periods, but as a self-publishing service, we work directly with authors without requiring literary representation. We accept manuscripts in all genres including fiction (literary, romance, thriller, science fiction, fantasy), non-fiction (business, self-help, memoirs, biography), children's books, poetry collections, and academic works. Submit anytime through our website—no appointment necessary, no submission fees, and no exclusive reading periods.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"How to submit a book proposal to publishers in Melbourne online?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"Our online submission process is straightforward. Visit our website and complete the submission form with your manuscript details including title, genre, word count, and a brief synopsis. Upload your complete manuscript or sample chapters (minimum 3 chapters for evaluation). Include your contact information and publishing objectives. Within 48 hours, our publishing consultants will review your submission and contact you to schedule a free consultation where we'll discuss editing needs, cover design options, distribution strategy, timeline, and pricing. No formal book proposal required—we focus on your finished manuscript and your goals as an author.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What are the leading Melbourne-based publishers for contemporary literature?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"While traditional Melbourne publishers like Text Publishing and Affirm Press focus on contemporary Australian fiction, our agency specialises in helping contemporary fiction authors self-publish with complete creative control. We've successfully published literary fiction, contemporary romance, urban fiction, women's fiction, and experimental novels. Our editors understand contemporary literary trends including character-driven narratives, diverse voices, Australian settings and themes, and genre-blending works. You retain 100% of royalties and rights while receiving the same professional editing, design, and distribution services as traditional publishers provide—often with faster timelines and higher author earnings.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which Melbourne publishers provide marketing and publicity services for authors?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"We offer comprehensive marketing support as part of our publishing packages. Our marketing services include Amazon book description optimisation with keyword research, author profile creation across all major platforms, category and keyword strategy to improve discoverability, social media marketing guidance, book launch planning and coordination, promotional pricing strategies, and email marketing templates. We also provide access to book promotion services including Goodreads author programme setup, BookBub and other promotional platform submissions, and reviewer outreach strategies. Unlike traditional publishers who focus marketing budgets on bestselling authors, we give every author professional marketing tools and guidance.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Which Melbourne publishers offer editing and manuscript development services?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"We provide three levels of professional editing services. Developmental editing addresses story structure, plot holes, character development, pacing issues, and narrative arc—typically for fiction manuscripts requiring substantial revisions (2-3 week turnaround). Copy editing focuses on grammar, punctuation, spelling, sentence structure, consistency, and style—suitable for polished manuscripts needing refinement (1-2 week turnaround). Proofreading offers final quality checks for typos, formatting errors, and minor mistakes before publication (3-5 day turnaround). Our editors specialise across genres and work with Australian and international English style guides. You'll receive tracked changes, editorial notes, and revision recommendations with every editing service.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"What are the Melbourne publishers with the fastest turnaround times for submissions?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"We review all manuscript submissions within 48 hours and provide initial feedback within 2-3 business days. Our complete publishing timeline from manuscript submission to live publication averages 4-6 weeks, significantly faster than traditional publishers who typically take 12-18 months. Here's our process breakdown: consultation and manuscript review (1-2 days), editing services (5-10 days depending on level), cover design with revisions (3-7 days), formatting and typesetting (3-5 days), ISBN registration (1-3 days), and global distribution setup (5-10 days for platform approval). Rush services are available for authors with specific launch deadlines, reducing total timeline to 2-3 weeks.\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n      \"name\": \"Who are the major Melbourne-based publishers distributing Australian travel books?\",\r\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n        \"text\": \"We distribute travel books globally through major platforms including Amazon (Australia, US, UK, Canada, Germany, France, Spain, Italy, Japan, India, Brazil), Apple Books, Google Play Books, Kobo, and 150+ international retailers. For Australian travel content specifically, we optimise your book for Australian readers through Amazon.com.au and local platform visibility while maintaining worldwide distribution. Our travel book services include photo optimisation and formatting for image-heavy content, maps and itinerary formatting, clickable table of contents by destination, and destination-based keyword strategy. We've published Australian travel guides, travel memoirs, destination-specific guides, adventure travel narratives, and cultural travel essays with successful distribution across domestic and international markets.\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}",
                "{\r\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n  \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n  \"name\": \"Professional Book Publishing Services\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Complete publishing services from ISBN registration to global distribution. Your book goes live on Amazon, Apple Books, Google Play, and 150+ retailers worldwide while you keep 100% of your rights and maximum royalties.\",\r\n  \"url\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/publishing/\",\r\n  \"provider\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\r\n    \"@id\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/#localbusiness\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"areaServed\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"Country\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Australia\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"serviceType\": \"Book Publishing\",\r\n  \"hasOfferCatalog\": {\r\n    \"@type\": \"OfferCatalog\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Publishing Services\",\r\n    \"itemListElement\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"eBook Publishing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"eBook publishing is the most accessible and cost-effective way to get your book into readers' hands globally. We handle everything from formatting your manuscript for digital platforms to distributing it across Amazon Kindle, Apple Books, Google Play, Kobo, and hundreds of other retailers.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Print-on-Demand Paperback Publishing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Print-on-demand paperback publishing eliminates upfront printing costs, books are printed individually when readers order them. We handle cover preparation for print, interior formatting to print specifications, ISBN assignment, and distribution through Amazon, IngramSpark, and other print retailers globally.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Hardcover Book Publishing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Hardcover books command higher prices, look more prestigious, and are often preferred for non-fiction, business books, and special editions. We publish hardcovers through print-on-demand services, making professional hardcover publishing accessible without minimum print runs or large upfront costs.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Large Print Publishing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Large print editions make your book accessible to readers with visual impairments and older readers who prefer larger text. We format large print editions to industry standards and distribute them through appropriate channels.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Custom Book Printing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Custom book printing services produce professional quality books in any quantity. Whether you need 50 copies for a speaking engagement or 500 for corporate distribution, we coordinate professional printing with fast turnaround.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"ISBN Registration & Copyright\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Every professionally published book needs proper registration and protection. We handle complete publishing administration so your book is properly catalogued, protected, and discoverable across all retail platforms and library systems.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Professional Editing & Proofreading\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Our experienced editors meticulously review your manuscript for grammar, spelling, punctuation, consistency, and readability. We offer multiple editing levels from basic proofreading to comprehensive developmental editing.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Custom Book Cover Design\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Our professional designers create eye-catching, genre-appropriate book covers that attract readers and boost sales. You receive multiple design concepts, unlimited revisions, and final files optimised for all major eBook platforms.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Ghostwriting\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Professional ghostwriters who bring your ideas to life across all genres, fiction, non-fiction, memoirs, business books, children's stories. You retain complete ownership and confidentiality while getting a professionally written manuscript.\"\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"Offer\",\r\n        \"itemOffered\": {\r\n          \"@type\": \"Service\",\r\n          \"name\": \"Book Marketing\",\r\n          \"description\": \"Strategic marketing campaigns that actually generate sales. We handle Amazon optimisation, social media marketing, email campaigns, book launches, paid advertising, review generation, and author platform building.\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}"
            ]
