            "{\r\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n        \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\r\n        \"mainEntity\": [{\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"What services do ebook marketing agencies in Melbourne offer?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"We offer comprehensive ebook marketing services including Amazon optimisation and advertising, social media marketing campaigns, email marketing and newsletter management, book launch coordination, paid advertising across multiple platforms, review generation strategies, author platform development, and media outreach. Our marketing services cover everything from initial launch campaigns to ongoing promotional efforts that keep your book visible and selling. Each campaign is customised to your genre, budget, and goals, we don't use cookie-cutter approaches. You'll receive Amazon keyword research and metadata optimisation, targeted ad campaigns managed and optimised continuously, social media content creation and posting, email sequences for launches and promotions, and detailed reporting on all campaign performance. We handle the entire marketing process so you can focus on writing while we focus on getting your book discovered.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"How to choose the best ebook marketing agency in Melbourne?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"Choosing us means working with a marketing agency that prioritizes measurable results over empty promises. We've been marketing books for Melbourne authors and internationally for nearly two decades, developing strategies that actually generate sales rather than just vanity metrics. What makes our agency the right choice is our transparent approach, we explain exactly what we'll do, why we're doing it, and what results to expect before you commit to anything. We provide detailed performance reports showing real ROI, not just impressions or clicks. Our team specialises in book marketing specifically, understanding genre conventions, reader behaviour, and platform algorithms that general marketing agencies don't grasp. During your free consultation, we'll discuss your book honestly, if we don't think marketing will be cost-effective yet, we'll tell you and explain what needs to happen first. That honesty is what builds lasting relationships with our authors.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Contact details for ebook marketing firms in Melbourne\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"You can contact us directly through our website's enquiry form, by phone, or via email. We respond to all marketing enquiries within 24 hours. To get started, visit our website and complete the marketing consultation form with your book details, title, genre, current sales if published, your marketing goals, and budget range. You can also upload your book cover and description. We'll review your information and contact you to schedule a free consultation where we'll discuss your specific situation and recommend appropriate marketing strategies. If you prefer to discuss your book before submitting formal details, call us directly or send an email with a brief overview of your project. All initial consultations are completely free with no obligation to proceed. We're based in Melbourne but work with authors throughout Australia and internationally through video consultations and online communication.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Where to hire ebook marketing experts in Melbourne?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"You can hire our ebook marketing experts directly through our website by submitting your project details and scheduling a free marketing consultation. We'll match you with marketing specialists who understand your specific genre, romance marketing requires different strategies than business book marketing or thriller promotion. Our experts have proven track records with measurable results across various genres and platforms. Submit your book information through our online portal, and we'll review your project within 24 hours. During your consultation, we'll discuss your current situation, identify opportunities for growth, and recommend a customised marketing strategy that fits your budget. You'll work directly with experienced marketers who specialise in book promotion, not generalist digital marketers learning as they go. Our team stays current with Amazon algorithm changes, social media trends, and emerging promotional opportunities so your campaigns use the most effective current strategies.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"Which agencies in Melbourne handle ebook launch promotions?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"We specialise in comprehensive ebook launch promotions that maximize your book's visibility during the crucial launch window. Our launch services include 90-day pre-launch planning and timeline development, advance review copy coordination for early reviews, Amazon optimisation for launch day visibility, multi-platform advertising campaigns timed for launch, social media buzz building before and during launch, email marketing to your list and promotional partners, press release creation and distribution, and post-launch momentum maintenance to prevent sales drop-off. Book launches are critical for long-term success, Amazon's algorithm favours books with strong initial sales velocity. We coordinate every element of your launch to create that momentum, from pre-orders through the first few weeks of availability. You'll receive a detailed launch timeline showing exactly what happens when, regular updates throughout the process, and complete performance reporting showing how your launch campaign performed.\"\r\n                }\r\n            },\r\n            {\r\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\r\n                \"name\": \"How do Melbourne ebook marketing agencies handle social media campaigns?\",\r\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"Answer\",\r\n                    \"text\": \"We handle social media campaigns through a strategic, results-focused approach that builds genuine audience engagement rather than just follower counts. Our social media marketing includes platform-specific content creation tailored to Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, Twitter, and other relevant platforms, consistent posting schedules that maintain visibility, audience growth strategies using both organic and paid methods, community engagement responding to comments and messages, paid social advertising targeted to your ideal readers, and performance tracking showing what content resonates with your audience. We don't just post randomly, every piece of content serves a purpose in your overall marketing strategy. For book launches, we create countdown content, behind-the-scenes glimpses, and launch day announcements. For ongoing promotion, we develop content themes that keep your audience engaged between books. You'll receive monthly reports showing audience growth, engagement rates, and how social media drives traffic to your book sales pages.\"\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        ]\r\n    }"
        ],
