h.com.au/#organization\"\r\n                },\r\n                \"areaServed\": {\r\n                    \"@type\": \"City\",\r\n                    \"name\": \"Melbourne\"\r\n                },\r\n                \"url\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/non-fiction-ghostwriting-service-in-melbourne/\",\r\n                \"image\": \"https://melbourneprintpublish.com.au/assets/images/portrait-focus-man.webp\",\r\n                \"description\": \"Professional non-fiction ghostwriting services for memoirs, business books, self-help books, academic manuscripts and personal development titles across Melbourne and Australia.\"\r\n            }\r\n\r\n        ]\r\n    }"
        ],
